    "Orange (#f2a541) is 2.05:1 on white: decorative or large-area use only on light backgrounds. Use step 600 for text.",
    "Brand colour 'Orange' is close in hue to the 'warning' state colour. Never signal warning by colour alone; pair it with an icon and text, and keep brand Orange out of warning messaging.",
    "Cyan and Success may be confused (tritanopia). Add labels, icons, patterns or a lightness difference wherever they carry meaning together.",
